{"sourceUrl":"http://www.cmm.zju.edu.cn/2026/0601/c38716a3168548/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:26.065725+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"http://www.cmm.zju.edu.cn/2026/0601/c38716a3168548/page.htm","html":"<div><p><span><span>浙江大学医学院秉承</span><span>“仁心仁术、求是求新”的院训，以“仁爱、求是、创新、卓越”为核心价值观，以培养高层次医学人才为使命，在百年岁月长河中书写了波澜壮阔的育人传奇，为社会培育了大量优秀医学人才，现已发展成为</span></span><span>享受较高国际荣誉、</span><span>师资力量雄厚</span><span>、</span><span>优势特色</span><span>明显</span><span>、</span><span>教育模式先进、</span><span>学术成绩卓著的</span><span>研究型、创新型学院</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>浙江大学医学院是国家首批博士、硕士学位授予单位，拥有基础医学、临床医学、</span><span><span>口腔医学、公共卫生与预防医学、护理学</span><span>5个一级学科博士学位授权点，共建药学、生物学、公共管理博士3个一级学科学位授权点。设有临床医学、口腔医学</span></span><span><span>和公共卫生</span><span>3</span></span><span><span>种博士专业学位类别，临床医学、口腔医学、公共卫生、护理</span><span>4种硕士专业学位类别。</span></span><span>现有博士研究生导师</span><span>7</span><span>48</span><span>人，硕士研究生导师</span><span>482</span><span>人。</span><span>下设</span><span>14</span><span>个二级招生单位。</span></p><p><span>为进一步促进各高校优秀大学生相互交流，拓展学术视野，提升科研能力，加强广大优秀学子对我院</span><span>及二级招生单位</span><span>的</span><span>了解</span><span><span>，特举办</span><span>“浙江大学</span></span><span>医学院</span><span>202</span><span>6</span><span><span>年优秀大学生夏令营</span><span>”，</span></span><span>旨在为</span><span>优秀学子</span><span>搭建</span><span>深入了解学科特色及学术资源的平台。</span></p><p><span>    一、夏令营概况</span></p><p><span>    本次夏令营</span><span>医学院</span><span>将邀请</span><span>各</span><span>二级招生单位</span><span>优秀教师和同学们进行交流，增</span><span>进</span><span>大家对我院</span><span>各单位</span><span>的</span><span>全面</span><span>了解。拟面向全国院校招收营员（包括本校</span><span>生，</span><span>招收</span><span>人数</span><span>由各</span><span>二级招生单位自行确定</span><span>），活动内容包括</span><span>医</span><span>学院</span><span>及二级招生单位</span><span>介绍、学科</span><span>专业</span><span>介绍、名师讲座、师生交流等。</span></p><p><span>    二、申请条件</span></p><p><span>1</span><span>.</span><span>全国高校</span><span>基础医学</span><span>、临床医学、</span><span>口腔医学、公共卫生、护理学等</span><span><span>相关专业的</span>202</span><span>7</span><span><span>届优秀本科毕业生（</span>202</span><span>7</span><span>年夏季毕业）；</span></p><p><span>2</span><span>.</span><span>学习成绩优秀，英语水平良好，身心健康；</span></p><p><span>3</span><span>.</span><span>欢迎</span><span>有志参加全国研究生招生考试并有意向攻读我院博士、硕士研究生者</span><span>申请</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>    三、申请方式</span></p><p><span>    本次夏令营的报名、录取和活动安排由</span><span>各二级招生单位</span><span>具体</span><span>组织</span><span>实施。各单位联系人</span><span>及联系方式</span><span>如下：</span></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span>二级招生单位</span></p></td><td><p><span>联系人</span></p></td><td><p><span>邮箱</span></p></td><td><p><span>联系电话</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>基础医学院</span></p></td><td><p><span>潘老师</span></p></td><td><p><span><a href=\"mailto:phbzll@zju.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">phbzll@zju.edu.cn</a></span></p></td><td><p><span>0571-88981287</span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span>脑科学与脑医学学院</span></p></td><td><p><span>赵老师</span></p></td><td><p><span><a href=\"mailto:yenizhao@zju.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">yenizhao@zju.edu.cn</a></span></p></td><td><p><span>0571-87076127</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>王老师</span></p></td><td><p><span>1476810580@qq.com</span></p></td><td><p><span>0571-85125730</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>公共卫生学院</span></p></td><td><p><span>李老师</span></p></td><td><p><span>lijr707@zju.edu.cn</span></p></td><td><p><span>0571-88981604</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>第一临床医学院</span></p></td><td><p><span><a href=\"mailto:%E8%83%A1%E8%80%81%E5%B8%88zju1graduate@163.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>沈</span><span>老师</span></a></span></p></td><td><p><span>fahzjuad@aliyun.com</span></p></td><td><p><span>0571-87231277</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>第二临床医学院</span></p></td><td><p><span>张</span><span>老师</span></p></td><td><p><span><a href=\"mailto:%E5%BC%A0%E8%80%81%E5%B8%88zjuzeyy2015@163.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">zjuzeyy2015@163.com</a></span></p></td><td><p><span>0571-87784594</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>第三临床医学院</span></p></td><td><p><span>陶</span><span>老师</span></p></td><td><p><span><a href=\"mailto:syf_yjs@163.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">syf_yjs@163.com</a></span></p></td><td><p><span>0571-860065</span><span>68</span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span>第四临床医学院</span></p><p><span>“一带一路”国际医学院（含遗传所）</span></p></td><td><p><span>吴老师</span></p></td><td><p><span>deer@zju.edu.cn</span></p></td><td><p><span>0579-89935023</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>高老师</span></p></td><td><p><span>yinglonggao@zju.edu.cn</span></p></td><td><p><span>0571-88208328</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>妇产科学院</span></p></td><td><p><span>汪老师</span></p></td><td><p><span><a href=\"mailto:zdfy@zju.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">zdfy@zju.edu.cn</a></span></p></td><td><p><span>0571-89998671</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>儿科学院</span></p></td><td><p><span>俞</span><span>老师</span></p></td><td><p><span><a href=\"mailto:chjyb@zju.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">chjyb@zju.edu.cn</a></span></p></td><td><p><span>0571-866700</span><span>54</span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span>口腔医学院</span></p></td><td><p><span>徐老师</span></p></td><td><p><span>weizhexu@zju.edu.cn</span></p></td><td><p><span>0571-87219287</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>董老师</span></p></td><td><p><span>dongshuting@zju.edu.cn</span></p></td><td><p><span>0571-87219287</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>护理系</span></p></td><td><p><span>黄老师</span></p></td><td><p><span><a href=\"mailto:huanghui1970@zju.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">huanghui1970@zju.edu.cn</a></span></p></td><td><p><span>0571-88208105</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>良渚实验室</span></p></td><td><p><span>王老师</span></p></td><td><p><span><a href=\"mailto:wyying@zju.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">wyying@zju.edu.cn</a></span></p></td><td><p><span>0571-88790286</span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span>转化医学研究院</span></p></td><td><p><span>金老师</span></p></td><td><p><span><a href=\"mailto:yiwenjin@zju.edu.cn%EF%BC%9B0571-86971603\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">yiwenjin@zju.edu.cn</a></span></p></td><td><p><span>0571-86971603</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>王老师</span></p></td><td><p><span><a href=\"mailto:mengyaowang@zju.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">mengyaowang@zju.edu.cn</a></span></p></td><td><p><span>0571-88981576</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>医学遗传与发育研究院</span></p></td><td><p><span>沈老师</span></p></td><td><p><span>yyshen219@163.com</span></p></td><td><p><span>0571-82295077</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span> </span></p><p><span>    报名步骤：</span></p><p><span>1.申请者</span><span>请</span><span>登录浙江大学研究生招生</span><span>管理系统，</span><span><span>链接地址：</span>https://yjsy.zju.edu.cn/grsinfo/zs/user/login，</span><span>注册后</span><span>进行网上报名</span><span><span>。具体操作详见学生操作手册（</span><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/be1cec7aab4d4a2533a5.gif\"/><a href=\"http://www.cmm.zju.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/39/60/f9c688894415a7d10e15c39fba35/394b6d8c-0690-40e3-b632-8bdde7e0695d.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">研究生招生管理系统夏令营模块学生操作手册.pdf</a>）</span></span><span>；</span></p><p><span>    2.</span><span>请将</span><span>所有证明材料原件按以下顺序扫描并</span><span><span>整合成</span><span>PDF（不超过10M）后，在网申系统“附件”中上传，</span></span><span><span>文件名为</span><span>“</span><span>报名</span></span><span>二级招生</span><span><span>单位</span>-姓名</span><span>-所在本科院校</span><span><span>”</span><span>；</span></span></p><p><span>    （</span><span>1</span><span>）个人身份证（正反面）；</span></p><p><span>    （</span><span>2</span><span><span>）本科成绩单（须加盖学校教务处或院系公章）</span>;</span></p><p><span>    （</span><span>3</span><span>）总评成绩排名证明（应包含所学专业同年级人数，须加盖学校教务处或院系公章）；</span></p><p><span>    （</span><span>4</span><span><span>）外语水平证明材料：</span>CET-6、雅思、托福、专业外语成绩等；</span></p><p><span>    （</span><span>5</span><span>）其他材料：如已发表论文、各类获奖或资格证书等。</span></p><p><span>    以上所有材料均应真实有效，若发现申请人有弄虚作假行为，取消其申请资格并通报申请人所在本科院校。</span></p><p><span>    特别提醒：</span><span>请于</span><span>二级招生单位规定时间</span><span>前</span><span>完成报名，逾期报名视为无效。</span><span>递交材料</span><span>内容</span><span>和递交形式以各单位夏令营通知中要求内容为准</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>    四、审核与录取</span></p><p><span>由我院各</span><span>二级</span><span>单位负责，择优录取</span><span>，</span><span>确定录取营员名单</span><span>。结果将通过夏令营报名系统公布，申请者可进入系统查看学院初审意见，</span><span>入选者也将收到各单位通知，未入选者不另行通知。被录取同学需</span><span>在截止时间前登入系统</span><span>，</span><span>确认</span><span>是否参加</span><span>，</span><span>逾期未确认视</span><span>作</span><span>放弃资格。</span></p><p><span>    五、夏令营安排</span></p><p><span>医学院各单位夏令营拟安排在</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>5</span><span><span>日</span><span>-7月</span></span><span>15</span><span>日，具体时间、</span><span>活动内容及形式</span><span>，</span><span>请关注</span><span>后续各二级</span><span>招生</span><span>单位通知</span><span>。</span></p><table><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><p><strong><span>二级招生单位夏令营公告链接（更新中）</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>基础医学院</span></p></td><td><p><span>https://bms.zju.edu.cn/2026/0506/c85156a3158495/page.htm</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>脑科学与脑医学学院</span></p></td><td><p><span>脑科学与脑医学学院</span><span>:</span><a href=\"http://www.neuroscience.zju.edu.cn/2026/0512/c75666a3161752/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>http://www.neuroscience.zju.edu.cn/2026/0512/c75666a3161752/page.htm</span></a></p><p><span>附属精神卫生中心:https://www.hz7hospital.com/educate/yxjy/4638.html</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>公共卫生学院</span></p></td><td><p><span>http://www.phs.zju.edu.cn/2026/0605/c47204a3175399/page.htm</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>第一临床医学院</span></p></td><td><p><span>https://www.zy91.com/content/default2/153/10112</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>第二临床医学院</span></p></td><td><p><span>https://www.z2hospital.com/contents/584/24439.html</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>第三临床医学院</span></p></td><td><p><span>https://www.srrsh.com/articleInfo/7110#content</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>第四临床医学院</span></p><p><span>“一带一路”国际医学院（含遗传所）</span></p></td><td><p><span>https://gjyxy.zju.edu.cn/2026/0612/c89456a3178047/page.htm</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>妇产科学院</span></p></td><td><p><span>https://www.womanschool.cn/index/article/details/id/537/pid/15/zid/0.html</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>儿科学院</span></p></td><td><p><span>https</span><span>://www.zjuch.cn/news/defau</span><span>lt/id/13921/cid/363</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>口腔医学院</span></p></td><td><span></span><p><span>https://www.zjuss.cn/24-5928</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>护理系</span></p></td><td><p><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/be1cec7aab4d4a2533a5.gif\"/><a href=\"http://www.cmm.zju.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/39/60/f9c688894415a7d10e15c39fba35/1e4f8973-c1f7-407f-9735-f1599d284091.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">浙江大学护理系关于举办2026优秀大学生夏令营的通知.pdf</a></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>良渚实验室</span></p></td><td><p><span>http://liangzhulab.zju.edu.cn/index.php?m=content&amp;c=index&amp;a=show&amp;catid=249&amp;id=2441</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>转化医学研究院</span></p></td><td><p><span>https://itm.zju.edu.cn/notice/details-2xlygzjdxzhyxyjyzbxlybmtz-1545.html</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>医学遗传与发育研究院</span></p></td><td><p><span>https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/5xh2SXN4G_ALWdqiHjgXNg</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span> </span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>浙江大学医学院</span></p><p><span>202</span><span>6</span><span>年</span><span>6</span><span>月</span><span>1</span><span>日</span></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"a0ac2766c1987a62d9676d96d66178ea8d514df443c364f516990a2cdb9f3bab","textLength":3084,"sourceSha256":"7dfde570f629602d0354b08a278d5200de380eebcc42e8c540f4a7dccc5ac280","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-c982f35510f7289281d7","title":"2026年浙江大学医学院关于举办2026年优秀大学生夏令营的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:26.065725+00:00","mirroredImages":[{"sourceUrl":"http://www.cmm.zju.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_pdf.gif","file":"assets/articles/media/be1cec7aab4d4a2533a5.gif"},{"sourceUrl":"http://www.cmm.zju.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_pdf.gif","file":"assets/articles/media/be1cec7aab4d4a2533a5.gif"}]}
